e command tree `.skilled/commands/<namespace>/<name>.md` owns which commands exist. The deriver fails when a command file has no `command-metadata.json` entry and no doctor route. It fails again when a declaration names a command with no file.\n \n A `command-metadata.json` entry and a doctor route or action carry the same risk keys. A value outside the accepted set fails the deriver before any policy is derived.\n \n | Risk key | Accepted values | Applies to |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"The command tree `.skilled/commands/<namespace>/<name>.md` owns which commands exist. The deriver fails when a command file has no `command-metadata.json` entry and no doctor route. It fails again when a declaration names a command with no file.\",\"oldString\":\"The command tree `.skilled/commands/<namespace>/<name>.md` owns which commands exist. The deriver fails when a command file has no `command-metadata.json` entry and no doctor route. It fails again when a declaration names a command with no file. Allow-list rows sit outside this check.\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794529110419,"end":1794529111642}}}}
