, or one record per route or action for a doctor command. Each record carries five keys: `command`, `route`, `mutating`, `askFirst`, `policy`. Nothing scores on it yet.\n \n-A metadata entry for a command that an allow-list row already carries adds no second bridge entry. The deriver keeps the allow-list row and drops the metadata entry, so one command keeps one id.\n-\n ---\n \n ## 9. RELATED\n \n","status":"modified","additions":0,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"`commandPolicies` in `command-bridges.generated.json` holds one record per command, or one record per route or action for a doctor command. Each record carries five keys: `command`, `route`, `mutating`, `askFirst`, `policy`. Nothing scores on it yet.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. RELATED\",\"oldString\":\"`commandPolicies` in `command-bridges.generated.json` holds one record per command, or one record per route or action for a doctor command. Each record carries five keys: `command`, `route`, `mutating`, `askFirst`, `policy`. Nothing scores on it yet.\\n\\nA metadata entry for a command that an allow-list row already carries adds no second bridge entry. The deriver keeps the allow-list row and drops the metadata entry, so one command keeps one id.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. RELATED\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794529114827,"end":1794529115826}}}}
