{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794529132579,"sessionID":"ses_e2dbc38ceffehjLznJD2sftp6i","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2457e32002neBoMvKraI0dwT","sessionID":"ses_e2dbc38ceffehjLznJD2sftp6i","messageID":"msg_1d24575d1001Ya1KpDfqPsilM1","type":"tool","id":"call_078cef08c8824b089dc59e26","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"limit":30,"offset":84,"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md, lines 84-113\n84: \n85: ---\n86: \n87: ## 6. HUMAN EDIT BOUNDARY\n88: \n89: Humans may edit `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, `scoring-compatibility.json` and `shadow-diff.md`. Regenerate `command-bridges.generated.json` after changing an authored input or the deriver. Do not edit the generated JSON directly.\n90: \n91: ---\n92: \n93: ## 7. VALIDATION\n94: \n95: Run the deriver in check mode from the repository root:\n96: \n97: ```bash\n98: node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs --check\n99: ```\n100: \n101: ---\n102: \n103: ## 8. RISK KEYS AND COMMAND POLICY\n104: \n105: The command tree `.skilled/commands/<namespace>/<name>.md` owns which commands exist. The deriver fails when a command file has no `command-metadata.json` entry and no doctor route. It fails again when a declaration names a command with no file.\n106: \n107: A `command-metadata.json` entry and a doctor route or action carry the same risk keys. A value outside the accepted set fails the deriver before any policy is derived.\n108: \n109: | Risk key | Accepted values | Applies to |\n110: |---|---|---|\n111: | `mutating` | `read-only`, `add-only`, `mutates` | Every metadata entry and every doctor route or action |\n112: | `gate3_location` | A non-empty string naming what the command writes | Required on every metadata entry |\n113: | `ask_first` | `settings`, `outside-repo`, `spend`, `relaunch` | Optional on both records |\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 114]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md, lines 84-113\n84: \n85: ---\n86: \n87: ## 6. HUMAN EDIT BOUNDARY\n88: \n89: Humans may edit `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, `scoring-compatibility.json` and `shadow-diff.md`. Regenerate `command-bridges.generated.json` after changing an authored input or the deriver. Do not edit the generated JSON directly.\n90: \n91: ---\n92: \n93: ## 7. VALIDATION\n94: \n95: Run the deriver in check mode from the repository root:\n96: \n97: ```bash\n98: node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs --check\n99: ```\n100: \n101: ---\n102: \n103: ## 8. RISK KEYS AND COMMAND POLICY\n104: \n105: The command tree `.skilled/commands/<namespace>/<name>.md` owns which commands exist. The deriver fails when a command file has no `command-metadata.json` entry and no doctor route. It fails again when a declaration names a command with no file.\n106: \n107: A `command-metadata.json` entry and a doctor route or action carry the same risk keys. A value outside the accepted set fails the deriver before any policy is derived.\n108: \n109: | Risk key | Accepted values | Applies to |\n110: |---|---|---|\n111: | `mutating` | `read-only`, `add-only`, `mutates` | Every metadata entry and every doctor route or action |\n112: | `gate3_location` | A non-empty string naming what the command writes | Required on every metadata entry |\n113: | `ask_first` | `settings`, `outside-repo`, `spend`, `relaunch` | Optional on both records |\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 114]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\":30,\"offset\":84,\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794529132082,"end":1794529132579}}}}
