" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md\nrg allow-list exit=1\n```\n\n`git diff --stat` confirms only this README changed (4 insertions, 7 deletions). The T040 checkbox in `tasks.md` was not ticked. Nothing was blocked.","time":{"start":1794529146418,"end":1794529149841}}}
